scope: AEP-Base-Node/crate/src/docking.rs AEP-Docks/ucb/crate AEP-Components/dock-post-beat-collect/crate CHANGELOG.md README.md
notes: Closed. After enqueue the client collects the applied DockFrameResponse by digest on the same unix dock. Deny carries deny.closed. Allow carries event_id. Enqueue still has no event_id until beat. UCB send_frame does not treat enqueue as Admit. The 1000 ms pulse is unchanged. Attractors stay forensic. TypeScript dynAEP remains. Base Node does not depend on aep-dynaep. UCB stays optional Path B. Hangar tools stay out of this ticket. AEP28-ENV-025 stays landed. Ticket close is coding close.
acceptance: After enqueue the client can collect the applied DockFrameResponse by digest or the dock line waits until beat. Deny carries deny.closed. Allow carries event_id. Enqueue still has no event_id until beat. cargo test -p aep-base-node --lib covers collect. nla-policy-scan gate coding-completion and project-completion-bac on AEP-Base-Node/crate.
bac: nla-policy-scan gate project-completion-bac /root/NLA-AEP-v2.8-open-source/AEP-Base-Node/crate
